{"root":{"data":{"id":"djdkhgx8fzk0","created":1781927230974,"text":"建设社会主义生态文明"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkjezodvc0","created":1781927383496,"text":"坚持人与自然和谐共生","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkjljvny00","created":1781927397779,"text":"生态兴则文明兴","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkjp2kwtc0","created":1781927405440,"text":"  - 自然是生命之母， 人与自然是生命共同体","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkjp2ltug0","created":1781927405441,"text":"  - 生态环境变化直接影响文明的兴衰演替  ","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkjp2lll40","created":1781927405441,"text":"  - 生态文明是人类文明发展的历史趋势  ","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkjp2ltlk0","created":1781927405441,"text":"  - 绵延 5000 多年的中华文明孕育着丰富的生态文化","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djdkjnk3mzc0","created":1781927402146,"text":"2. 绿水青山就是金山银山","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djdkjuglx3s0","created":1781927417172,"text":"  - 生态环境问题归根到底是经济发展方式和生活方式问题  ","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkjuglpk00","created":1781927417172,"text":"  - 表面上，生态环境保护和经济发展是矛盾对立的关系，是鱼和熊掌不可兼得的两难选择","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkk4k791s0","created":1781927439157,"text":"根本上，二者是辩证统一、相辅相成的关系","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djdkk634ezc0","created":1781927442478,"text":"揭示了保护生态环境就是保护生产力，改善生态环境就是发展生产力的道理","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}